   party storage. This creates a high threat to user data security and
   there is a huge demand for securing the user data. In order to protect
   user data from the intruder, many data encryption techniques have been
   proposed. In this paper, an analysis has been provided in the research
   of data security in the cloud storage with various output parameters.
